                          "name": "Problem Text",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "gap": 16,
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "q6aT1",
                              "name": "Para",
                              "fill": "$pg-ink-soft",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Students were starting the placement test and disappearing. The obvious explanation was difficulty or motivation. The logs said something else: legitimate mobile behaviour was being flagged as cheating, and the attempt was silently killed.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.7,
                              "fontFamily": "$body",
                              "fontSize": 15,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "Eqj34",
                              "name": "Para 2",
                              "fill": "$pg-ink-soft",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "My job wasn't only to fix the rule. It was to make the failure recoverable: keep the student's answers, let them resume, and make sure the same false positive couldn't end the session.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.7,
                              "fontFamily": "$body",
                              "fontSize": 15,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
